    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;国庆假期我们来到了幽云十六州中的蔚州，参观了这里的博物馆和古城，感受这里的千年魅力。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpKxVsNICO-yOLgClPs4JMkKjXqi.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsLbu77KqLWuW4cIM193IeC2bc8X.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkQoafbDStzlD_yy9Yg4fnQuTwon.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrGXa5kLxBG1LXOBSN6DKhWMdJr6.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlqXqigOei0Rzip3DYYWqP4-Incx.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>谁还不是个小可爱呢？ 痴汉笑O(∩_∩)O哈哈~</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Ft_7WoR968mHDDaSKBtfHl72EZec.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>感兴趣的盆友可以扫码了解古物奇珍。</span></p>]]></description>
